            "verseId": "LUK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 5.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.7.10+1CO.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilkor 7.10-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ore oltung'ani ake pooki oituraa enkitok enye neyam ai keloloito. Ore oloyam enkitok natung'uayie olmoruo lenye naa keloloito.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oltung'ani karsis o Lasaro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki, “Etii apa oltung'ani karsis, oishop olkila onyokie o loibor, nenya olkar nkolong'i pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirrag te kutuk aji e nkaji enye oltung'ani aisinani oomonisho oji Lasaro, oata mpaldakani ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oyieu neitaraposh kewan too mbelat naasulunye te mesa o lkarsis; neaku kepuonu ldiein aamej mpaldakani enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neye ilo aisinani nenap ilmalaika aaya olgoo le Abraham. Neye sii ninye olkarsis nenukari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore etii Yehanum, eitamei, nedumu nkonyek, nedol Abraham elakua netii Lasaro olgoo lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipotisho ajo, ‘Papa Abraham, ing'urrieki, irriu Lasaro meitadoiki olkimojino lenye enkare naaitong'aki olng'ejep lai; amu aainosita ena kima.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaka Abraham, ‘Nakerai, tadamu nchere inoto olkar loo mbaa pooki inchu te nkop, ore Lasaro nenoto sii ninye osina, kake ore taata neitishipi etii ene, nitii iyie osina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore etii kuna pooki, etipikaki eng'erem narish iyiook o intae, pee melang'u ole naalo ine nemelang'u oleine alotu ene nikitii.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki, ‘Aatasayia naa, papa, irriwai ninye metaa olkilikuai te nkang e papa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu imiet ilalashera laata, metoliki pee mepuonu sii ninche ene wueji o somit.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaaka Abraham, ‘Eeta Musa o loibonok le Nkai inchoo ninche ening lelo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki, ‘A'a papa Abraham mme neijia; te netum olkilikuai loolooinguaa ilootuata, neirridu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye, ‘Te nemening Musa o loibonok le Nkai, nemening sii ninye oloing'uaa lootuata.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
